{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name='description' content='Reach out for a warm, practical conversation about next steps. Sliding-scale openings and brief consults available.'>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbf9f7; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b6b6b; --accent:#6a4eff; --accent-2:#00bfa6; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --radius:14px; --shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(42,36,74,0.06);
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff 60%);color:#222}
    header{padding:28px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:#333;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(106,78,255,0.18)}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:20px auto;padding:18px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:20px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Pattern inset */
    .pattern-back{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.06}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .pricing-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfbfc,#fff);border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);width:max-content}
    .pricing-toggle button{background:none;border:0;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .pricing-toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white}
    .pricing-list{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
    .price-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    .price-title{font-weight:700}
    .price-figure{font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, 'Roboto Mono';font-size:18px}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .mood-grid{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .mood-pill{padding:10px 12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer}
    .mood-pill.selected{background:var(--accent);color:white;border-color:transparent}
    .method-plate{margin-top:16px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfbff);border:1px solid rgba(106,78,255,0.06)}

    form label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);background:var(--glass);}
    textarea{min-height:100px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:12px 16px;background:var(--accent);color:white;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .secondary{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);color:#333}
    footer{max-width:980px;margin:20px auto;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .disclosure{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}

    @media (max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.card{padding:16px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <svg class='pattern-back' width='100%' height='100%' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>
    <defs>
      <pattern id='p1' width='80' height='80' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'>
        <rect width='80' height='80' fill='rgba(230,230,250,0.95)' />
        <circle cx='12' cy='12' r='4' fill='rgba(106,78,255,0.06)' />
        <circle cx='68' cy='68' r='4' fill='rgba(0,191,166,0.04)' />
        <path d='M0 40 L80 40' stroke='rgba(106,78,255,0.02)' stroke-width='1'/>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(#p1)' />
  </svg>

  <header>
    <div class='brand'>
      <div class='logo' aria-hidden='true'>TH</div>
      <div>
        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Warm, practical clinical care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label='Primary navigation'>
      <a href='index.html'>Welcome</a>
      <a href='about.html'>Practice</a>
      <a href='specialties.html'>Offerings</a>
      <a href='approach.html'>How I Work</a>
      <a href='fees.html'>Investment</a>
      <a href='book.html' style='color:var(--accent)'>Start</a>
      <a href='contact.html' style='opacity:0.8'>Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class='grid'>
      <section class='card' aria-labelledby='connect-heading'>
        <h1 id='connect-heading'>Reach out for a brief consult</h1>
        <p class='lead'>If you’re wondering what next steps look like, a 20-minute phone consult can help clarify fit and pairing. I aim to be direct, practical, and kind.</p>

        <div style='margin-top:10px'>
          <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:var(--accent)'>{{PHONE}}</a><br>
          <strong>Email:</strong> <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--accent)'>{{EMAIL}}</a>
        </div>

        <hr style='margin:16px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)'>

        <div>
          <label for='name'>Your name</label>
          <input id='name' name='name' placeholder='Full name' />
          <label for='email'>Email</label>
          <input id='email' name='email' placeholder='you@example.com' />
          <label for='phone'>Phone (optional)</label>
          <input id='phone' name='phone' placeholder='(optional)' />
          <label for='note'>A short note about what's bringing you here</label>
          <textarea id='note' name='note' placeholder='A few sentences helps me prepare'></textarea>

          <div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px'>
            <a id='primaryCta' class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <button id='mailtoBtn' class='secondary' style='padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px' type='button'>Send via Email</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class='disclosure'>All communications are treated with clinical confidentiality except where safety or law require disclosure. Services are therapeutic and do not replace emergency support. If you are in crisis or danger, call local emergency services or 988 right away.</p>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class='card'>
          <h2 style='margin:0 0 6px'>Investment snapshot</h2>
          <p class='lead'>Flexible ways to access brief, regular, or focused work. Toggle to compare month-to-month vs. package pricing.</p>

          <div style='margin-top:8px'>
            <div class='pricing-toggle' role='tablist' aria-label='Pricing view'>
              <button id='monthlyBtn' class='active' role='tab' aria-selected='true'>Month</button>
              <button id='packageBtn' role='tab' aria-selected='false'>Package</button>
            </div>

            <div class='pricing-list' aria-live='polite'>
              <div class='price-row'>
                <div>
                  <div class='price-title'>Focused Session</div>
                  <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>50-minute, targeted work</div>
                </div>
                <div class='price-figure' data-month='160' data-package='300'>$160</div>
              </div>

              <div class='price-row'>
                <div>
                  <div class='price-title'>Support Continuity</div>
                  <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Two sessions per month</div>
                </div>
                <div class='price-figure' data-month='280' data-package='520'>$280</div>
              </div>

              <div class='price-row'>
                <div>
                  <div class='price-title'>Growth Package</div>
                  <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>6-session bundle with a planning call</div>
                </div>
                <div class='price-figure' data-month='96' data-package='540'>$96</div>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

          <p style='font-size:13px;margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Packages are billed in full at the outset; monthly plans recur. Sliding scale and occasional pro bono spaces are available by request.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='card' style='margin-top:14px'>
          <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Mood-to-Method selector</h3>
          <p class='lead'>Pick a current feeling. The recommended approach adjusts and the primary CTA updates to match.</p>

          <div class='mood-grid' role='listbox' aria-label='Select mood'>
            <button class='mood-pill' data-key='overwhelmed'>Overwhelmed</button>
            <button class='mood-pill' data-key='stuck'>Stuck</button>
            <button class='mood-pill' data-key='restless'>Restless</button>
            <button class='mood-pill' data-key='curious'>Curious</button>
          </div>

          <div class='method-plate' id='methodPlate'>
            <strong id='methodTitle'>Brief consult</strong>
            <div id='methodDesc' style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px'>A short call to clarify goals and match a plan.</div>
            <div style='margin-top:12px'><a id='methodAction' class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
          </div>

          <p style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px'>Suggestions are clinical guidance, not guarantees. If there is immediate risk or safety concern, contact emergency services.</p>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    Confidentiality: sessions are private within clinical and legal limits. Scope: psychotherapy for individuals and couples; I do not provide forensic evaluations here. For questions about records or insurance, contact the practice directly.
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Pricing comparator
    (function(){
      const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById('monthlyBtn');
      const packageBtn = document.getElementById('packageBtn');
      const figures = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.price-figure'));

      let mode = 'month';
      function setMode(m){
        mode = m;
        monthlyBtn.classList.toggle('active', m==='month');
        packageBtn.classList.toggle('active', m==='package');
        monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected', m==='month');
        packageBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected', m==='package');
        figures.forEach(el=>animateValue(el, Number(el.getAttribute('data-'+m)), el===figures[2] && m==='month' ? '$' : '$'));
      }

      function animateValue(el, target, prefix){
        const start = Number(el.textContent.replace(/[^0-9.]/g,'')) || 0;
        const duration = 500;
        const startTime = performance.now();
        function tick(now){
          const t = Math.min(1,(now-startTime)/duration);
          const eased = t<.5?2*t*t: -1+ (4-2*t)*t; // ease
          const val = Math.round(start + (target-start)*eased);
          el.textContent = prefix + val;
          if(t<1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(tick);
      }

      monthlyBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>setMode('month'));
      packageBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>setMode('package'));

      // initialize with month numbers from data-month
      figures.forEach(el=>{ el.textContent = '$' + el.getAttribute('data-month'); });
    })();

    // Mood-to-Method selector
    (function(){
      const pills = document.querySelectorAll('.mood-pill');
      const methodTitle = document.getElementById('methodTitle');
      const methodDesc = document.getElementById('methodDesc');
      const methodAction = document.getElementById('methodAction');
      const primaryCta = document.getElementById('primaryCta');

      const map = {
        'overwhelmed':{
          title:'Short stabilization plan',
          desc:'Begin with focused strategies to reduce immediate overwhelm, then move to regular sessions for planning and pacing.',
          cta:'Book a stabilization call',
          href:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?focus=stabilization'
        },
        'stuck':{
          title:'Goal-focused series',
          desc:'A structured short series to identify barriers and set concrete, measurable steps forward.',
          cta:'Start a short series',
          href:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?focus=series'
        },
        'restless':{
          title:'Exploratory sessions',
          desc:'A lightly structured approach to try different methods and discover what settles restlessness over time.',
          cta:'Try exploratory sessions',
          href:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?focus=explore'
        },
        'curious':{
          title:'Consult & plan',
          desc:'A consult to map possibilities and co-design a plan that fits your life and priorities.',
          cta:'Schedule a consult',
          href:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?focus=consult'
        }
      };

      function selectKey(key, el){
        pills.forEach(p=>p.classList.remove('selected'));
        if(el) el.classList.add('selected');
        const item = map[key];
        methodTitle.textContent = item.title;
        methodDesc.textContent = item.desc;
        methodAction.textContent = item.cta;
        methodAction.setAttribute('href', item.href);
        primaryCta.textContent = item.cta;
        primaryCta.setAttribute('href', item.href);
      }

      pills.forEach(p=>p.addEventListener('click', (e)=>{ selectKey(p.getAttribute('data-key'), p); }));

      // default
      selectKey('curious', document.querySelector('.mood-pill[data-key="curious"]'));

    })();

    // lightweight mailto action
    document.getElementById('mailtoBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value || '';
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value || '';
      const phone = document.getElementById('phone').value || '';
      const note = document.getElementById('note').value || '';
      const subject = encodeURIComponent('Contact from website');
      const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: '+name+'\nEmail: '+email+'\nPhone: '+phone+'\n\nNote:\n'+note);
      location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact page — private_practice_therapist

This bundle contains the contact page and documentation for the clinic_modern layout. Files included:

- contact.html — interactive contact page with pricing comparator and mood-to-method selector.

How to run

1. Place `contact.html` in the same folder as the rest of the site (index.html, about.html, etc.).
2. Open `contact.html` in a browser. No server required for basic interactions.

Features implemented

- Pricing Comparator toggle
  - Two modes: Month (recurring) and Package (prepaid). Click the pills to switch.
  - Numbers animate with a subtle easing; values are taken from `data-month` and `data-package` attributes.
  - Accessible state reflected via `aria-selected` on the toggle buttons and `aria-live` on the pricing block.

- Mood-to-Method selector
  - Choose a present state (Overwhelmed / Stuck / Restless / Curious).
  - The recommended approach title, description, and both the side-panel CTA and main CTA update to reflect the selected approach.
  - CTA links include a query fragment to indicate intent (e.g. `?focus=stabilization`).

Content and clinical notes

- Language follows clinician norms: supportive, non-promising, and includes confidentiality and crisis guidance.
- No medical claims are made.

Accessibility and notes

- The markup uses simple ARIA attributes (`role='tablist'`, `aria-selected`, `aria-live`) to support assistive technologies.
- Colors are controlled by CSS variables in the head of the document; you can adjust them to match brand needs.

Customization

- Replace placeholders: `{{BUSINESS_NAME}}`, `{{PHONE}}`, `{{EMAIL}}`, `{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}`, `{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}`, `{{CITY}}`, `{{STATE}}`.
- Pricing values: edit the `data-month` and `data-package` attributes on elements with class `price-figure`.
- Mood mappings: edit the `map` object in the inline script to change titles, descriptions, CTA labels, and href values.

Notes

- No external fonts, CDNs, or images are required.
- The pattern is embedded as inline SVG for visual texture.
- Keep therapy content conservative: do not promise outcomes and include crisis instructions as provided.

If you want this page as a standalone file with a separate CSS and JS, I can split the inline styles and scripts into separate assets for clarity."}
BUNDLE_END
